A cleared focus binding releases the actual Compose focus target. Recheck ownership inside the effect so a focus transfer preserves its new target.

diff --git a/Sources/SkipUI/SkipUI/System/Focus.swift b/Sources/SkipUI/SkipUI/System/Focus.swift
--- a/Sources/SkipUI/SkipUI/System/Focus.swift
+++ b/Sources/SkipUI/SkipUI/System/Focus.swift
@@ -2,9 +2,11 @@
